Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 01:10:55 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Per-game: E-cores only (P-cores left free), live, no
 reboot

Asked for on r/MSIClaw ("a toggle to hide the P cores as E cores, like Motion
Assistant"); on Windows it needs a reboot, so other tools skipped it. On Linux the
launch wrapper runs the game under taskset on the E-cores with an L3 (Panther
Lake 2-9; LP-E cores 10-13 left out as slower). It ends with the game.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019jJLUgw5uVPaAcLuRF5SqW
