+- **E-cores only, per game (2026-11-05, r/MSIClaw request):** Per-game → E-cores only on, start a game: ClawDeck's log
+  line "clawdeck: E-cores only (2-9)" in the game's Proton output, and `ps -L -o psr= -p $(pgrep -f <game>.exe)`
